# Claude Code — personal, machine-local permission grants.
# Every allowed command is recorded verbatim, so this file accumulates whatever was
# typed during a session: local URLs, test addresses, one-off curl bodies. That is
# not shareable state and this repository is public. The project-wide file
# (.claude/settings.json) is the one to commit if the team ever needs shared rules.
.claude/settings.local.json
